  "answer_text": "Here's a roundup of the **best laptop deals online right now** across different categories and budgets:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Best Places to Find Laptop Deals\n\nYou can find all kinds of deals across a wide range of online retailers such as **Newegg, Walmart, Best Buy, Amazon**, and more. It's also worth checking out deals directly from laptop manufacturers like **Lenovo, HP, and Dell**.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udcbb Top Laptop Deals by Category\n\n### \ud83c\udfc6 Best Overall (Premium Pick)\nThe **Lenovo Yoga** (14-inch) stands out as one of the best Windows laptops right now, featuring a **14-inch 2880\u00d71800 OLED display** with up to 120Hz, an **Intel Core Ultra 7 258V CPU, 32GB of RAM, 1TB SSD**, and Intel Arc 140V graphics. It weighs under three pounds and the battery can last up to **23 hours**.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcb0 Best Budget Pick\nNeed an affordable laptop for the basic stuff? The **Dell 15 Laptop** is a great choice. Its AMD Ryzen 3 7320U chip is well suited for daily tasks like browsing, streaming, and email.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfae Best Gaming Deals\nThe **RTX 5060 Lenovo gaming laptop** is one of the best gaming deals of the week \u2014 featuring an OLED display, Ultra 7 chipset, 32GB of RAM, and **$400 off**.\n\nOther gaming laptops currently on sale at Best Buy include:\n- **ASUS ROG Zephyrus G16** \u2013 16\" 2.5K OLED 240Hz, Intel Core Ultra 9 285H, NVIDIA RTX 5070, 1TB SSD\n- **ASUS ROG Zephyrus G14** \u2013 14\" 3K OLED 120Hz, AMD Ryzen AI 9 HX, NVIDIA RTX 5080, 2TB SSD\n- **Lenovo Legion Pro 5** \u2013 16\" 2.5K, AMD Ryzen 9 8945HX, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5060, 1TB SSD\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd04 Best 2-in-1 Deals\nCurrently on sale at Best Buy:\n- **HP OmniBook X Flip 2-in-1** \u2013 16\" 2K OLED Touchscreen, Intel Core Ultra 5 (2026), 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD\n- **Lenovo Yoga 7a 2-in-1** \u2013 14\" 2K OLED Touchscreen, AMD Ryzen AI 7 445, 24GB RAM, 512GB SSD\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcda Best Chromebook Deals\nAffordable Chromebook options include the **Acer Chromebook 315** (15.6\" FHD, MediaTek Kompanio 540, 128GB) and the **Lenovo Chromebook Plus** (15.3\" 2K Touchscreen, Intel Core 3 Processor N355, 8GB RAM, 128GB UFS).\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf4e Best MacBook Deals\nYou can save up to **$300 on the Apple MacBook Air** \u2014 with deals available on both the M4 and M5 models.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udca1 Quick Buying Tips\n\n- Aim for at least **8GB of RAM** (16GB is preferable, especially for gaming). Avoid laptops with under 4GB of RAM or 128GB of SSD storage.\n- **Chromebooks** make great everyday machines and are generally more affordable than Windows laptops.\n- A **Windows laptop** is more versatile and can be configured with more RAM, storage, and more.\n\n---\n\nFor the latest live deals, check out:\n- \ud83d\udd17 [PCWorld Laptop Deals](https://www.pcworld.com/article/550968/best-laptop-deals-3.html)\n- \ud83d\udd17 [Best Buy Laptop Sales](https://www.bestbuy.com/site/all-computers-tablets-on-sale/laptops-on-sale/pcmcat1720704669400.c)\n- \ud83d\udd17 [HP Weekly Deals](https://www.hp.com/us-en/shop/slp/weekly-deals/laptops)\n- \ud83d\udd17 [TechRadar Best Laptop Deals](https://www.techradar.com/news/the-best-laptop-deals)\n- \ud83d\udd17 [BestLaptop.deals](https://www.bestlaptop.deals/)",
